hallenge</strong><br>When you make a bad jump, you come up to find the cat on the top, but if you fall down the endless mountain, you'll feel pain<br>Once you're used to it and you're aware of the game's movement, the jump system, you'll be able to clear it without difficulty<br><br><strong>Please go up to the top of the mountain and find Nuri!</strong>",
